# Morse pair potentials for Au0.5Cu0.5 FCC L10 intermetallic alloy
# Based on Girifalco & Weizer, Phys. Rev. 114, 687 (1959) and L10 CuAu ordering energetics
species
Au  core  0.000
Cu  core  0.000

morse
Au  core  Au  core  0.4750  1.5830  2.8850  0.0  6.50
Cu  core  Cu  core  0.3429  1.3588  2.8660  0.0  6.50
Au  core  Cu  core  0.4320  1.4850  2.7400  0.0  6.50
